# Deps & build artifacts (installed/built fresh inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/.turbo

# Local databases, uploads, collab state (use volumes instead)
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/dev.db*
**/.uploads
**/data
apps/collab/data

# Env & secrets (provided at runtime via compose)
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local

# VCS / editor / OS
.git
.gitignore
**/.DS_Store
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Scratch / docs not needed at runtime
**/*.md
